            <p>{item.body}</p>
            <p class="checkpoint__note">{item.note}</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="salary">
    <p class="eyebrow">Real numbers</p>
    <h2>Realistic e-commerce operations salary progression in India</h2>
    <p>
      Pay in this field tracks fairly closely with general operations pay, trending toward the higher end because of the sector's complexity and pace. The numbers below reflect current Indian hiring and salary reporting and vary by company size, city, and function — treat them as a realistic range, not a guarantee.
    </p>

    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table class="paths-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Career stage</th>
            <th>Typical experience</th>
            <th>Typical pay range</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Career stage"><strong>Operations executive / catalog associate</strong></td>
            <td data-label="Typical experience">0-2 years</td>
            <td data-label="Typical pay range">Rs 4-7 LPA</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Career stage"><strong>Assistant manager</strong></td>
            <td data-label="Typical experience">~2 years</td>
            <td data-label="Typical pay range">Rs 7-11 LPA</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Career stage"><strong>Operations / marketplace manager</strong></td>
            <td data-label="Typical experience">4-5 years</td>
            <td data-label="Typical pay range">Rs 12-20 LPA</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Career stage"><strong>Senior lead / head of operations</strong></td>
            <td data-label="Typical experience">8-10+ years</td>
            <td data-label="Typical pay range">Rs 20-35 LPA</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="note-line">
      City matters a lot here: Bangalore tends to lead at roughly Rs 14-24 LPA for mid-level operations roles given the concentration of tech and e-commerce companies, while tier-2 cities like Pune or Hyderabad run closer to Rs 10-16 LPA at the same level, with meaningfully lower living costs. Verify current numbers against live job listings before deciding based on any single figure, since ranges shift by employer and year.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="mistakes">
    <p class="eyebrow">Avoid waste</p>
    <h2>Mistakes that stall an e-commerce operations career</h2>
    <div class="mistakes-list">
      {mistakeItems.map((item) => (
        <article class="mistake-item">
